@node Main "AmigaGPT"
@{b}AmigaGPT@{ub}

Welcome to the future of language modelling on the classic AmigaOS, AmigaGPT. Built to tap into the power of Artificial Intelligence, this program will take your Amiga experience to new horizons.

@{b}Click on any topic to learn more.@{ub}

  @{"Introduction                    " link intro}
