  @{b}Cut@{ub}                  Right-Amiga + X
  @{b}Copy@{ub}                 Right-Amiga + C
  @{b}Paste@{ub}                Right-Amiga + V
  @{b}Clear@{ub}                Right-Amiga + L
  @{b}Select all@{ub}           Right-Amiga + A

These act on the text field that has the keyboard focus and are greyed out when neither text field is active. See @{"Editing text" link editmenu}.

@{b}View@{ub}

