See @{"Changing the appearance" link appearance}.

@{b}Connection@{ub}

  @{b}Proxy@{ub}
    @{b}Enabled@{ub}                              toggle
    @{b}Settings...@{ub}                          host, port, encryption, auth

See @{"Using a proxy server" link proxy}.

@{b}Chat@{ub}

  @{b}Chat Provider Settings...@{ub}               provider, model, key, tools

See @{"Chat Provider Settings" link chatprofiles}.

@{b}Image@{ub}

